# HOSTMAN-FRONTEND — environment template.
# Copy to .env and adjust per environment. Never commit real .env (§10).

# Base URL of the HOSTMAN-BACKEND API (no trailing slash).
# Backend default (docs/backend-api/README.md): http://127.0.0.1:8080
